     "name": "nod"
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "Sworn. The book says none of the four faces is slow, madam.",
     "to": "rosalind"
    },
    {
     "do": "wait",
     "secs": 1.5
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "All four run four minutes behind. Together. On purpose, since 1887.",
     "to": "rosalind"
    }
   ],
   "t": 41.37
  },
  {
   "actor": "wren",
   "append": false,
   "commands": [
    {
     "do": "look_at",
     "target": "clerk"
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "Tell us plainly, sir. Which face runs slow?",
     "to": "clerk"
    }
   ],
   "t": 42.27
  },
  {
   "actor": "rosalind",
   "append": false,
   "commands": [
    {
     "do": "act",
     "name": "shrug"
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "All four? On purpose? Keeper, that is not a clock, that is a conspiracy. Why?",
     "to": "clerk"
    }
   ],
   "t": 43.17
  },
  {
   "actor": "clerk",
   "append": false,
   "commands": [
    {
     "do": "look_at",
     "target": "wren"
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "The carpenter who hung the clock was four minutes late the day he died.",
     "to": "wren"
    },
    {
     "do": "wait",
     "secs": 1.2
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "So the town gave him four minutes back. Every hour, for ever.",
     "to": "rosalind"
    },
    {
     "do": "act",
     "name": "bow"
    }
   ],
   "t": 44.07
  },
  {
   "actor": "wren",
   "append": false,
   "commands": [
    {
     "do": "wait",
     "secs": 1.0
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "Then my watch is the one that is wrong. I shall set it back.",
     "to": "clerk"
    },
    {
     "do": "act",
     "name": "nod"
    },
    {
     "do": "look_at",
     "target": "rosalind"
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "Supper, then, your honour. But first, four minutes for the carpenter.",
     "to": "rosalind"
    }
   ],
   "t": 45.99
  },
  {
   "actor": "rosalind",
   "append": false,
   "commands": [
    {
     "do": "look_at",
     "target": "clerk"
    },
    {
     "do": "act",
     "name": "plead"
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "Four minutes back, every hour. Keeper, that is the kindest thing I ever heard a town do.",
     "to": "clerk"
    }
   ],
   "t": 46.89
  },
  {
   "actor": "rosalind",
   "append": false,
   "commands": [
    {
     "do": "look_at",
     "target": "wren"
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "Both lose? Never. Hear the verdict of this court:",
     "to": "wren"
    },
    {
     "do": "act",
     "name": "verdict"
    },
    {
     "do": "say",
     "text": "Both faces acquitted. The clock is guilty of loyalty. The guinea buys us supper.",
     "to": "wren"
    }
   ],
   "t": 49.28
  },
  {
   "actor": "wren",
   "append": false,
   "commands": [
